{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Who Dwell is a slow-burn folk-horror descent where light is your only protection. Explore a cursed underground excavation, restore ancient shrines, and manage your fading lantern as something watches from the dark. Survival depends on exploration and ritual choices, not combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven folk horror with psychological elements, inspired by folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your lifeline so manage your torch, oil and candles to push back the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension, dread and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and interactable items that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different endings based on your choices and how you engage with what dwells below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game: 2~ hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content described on this page is included in the current version of the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lore Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762690/43bf4ea9af09c5ffa31b1ca6fe2a60edf9375103.jpg"},{"name":"Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762690/8403ca4337dfe40d2db6a733d47035e895d4849f.jpg"},{"name":"The Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762690/c44b955022d7db4911ed1a72056411e07f5e2a84.jpg"},{"name":"Those Who Dwell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762690/