s, and manage your fading lantern as something watches from the dark. Survival depends on exploration and ritual choices, not combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven folk horror with psychological elements, inspired by folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your lifeline so manage your torch, oil and candles to push back the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension, dread and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and interactable items that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different endings based on your choices and how you engage with what dwells below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game: 2~ hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content described on this page is included in the current version of the game.</p>","developers":["Midnight Forge LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762690/201c1dfab71102145f1e0a6ffc27b6cd4eb8520b/header.jpg?t=1774287961","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3762690/1684353242/eff1e373a05d6b9859a1e68a2d6002532e3760c3/1770996527/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771675879","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3762690/1684353242/eff1e373a05d6b9859a1e68a2d6002532e3760c3/1770996527/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771675879","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3762690/1684353242/eff1e373a05d6b9859a1e68a